2. Export this function and add it to the `operationTable` in `src/protocol_adapter.ts`

Looking at the existing code:
- `advanceZef1`: nim -> pex, requires Tal === "pex"
- `advanceZef2`: pex -> dor, requires Tal === "pex"

The invariant I2 states "Zef=dor ⟹ Tal=pex". So the precondition should require Tal === "pex" to maintain this invariant.

